<title>HUNGARY: Borsodchem appeals HUF322mln custom charge.</title>
<headline>Borsodchem appeals HUF322mln custom charge.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian chemicals company Borsodchem Rt said on Wednesday it had lodged an appeal against customs and tax charges on the lease of rail carriages totalling 322 million forints.</p>
<p>&quot;The lease of rail carriages was exempt of customs in the period (when Borsodchem leased them),&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>It added that the company was asking the Customs Office to reverse the decision.</p>
<p>Customs officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
